WEBVTT

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:24.300
Miyuki... are we there yet?

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:26.200
Not long now!

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:29.900
Can't believe there aren't no buses or taxis round here...

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:32.090
You okay back there, Akane?

00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:35.180
I'm gonna need to take a break...

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:37.880
Don't see that every day. Akane being the one holding us up.

00:00:38.270 --> 00:00:42.220
It's been too hot to eat lately, so I ain't got much strength in me...

00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:43.770
Heat fatigue, huh?

00:00:43.770 --> 00:00:46.030
Sorry I made you walk all this way, then!

00:00:46.030 --> 00:00:50.200
Ah, it's fine. I'll be back on my feet in no time!

00:00:50.730 --> 00:00:52.560
It has been awfully hot of late, hasn't it?

00:00:58.590 --> 00:01:02.440
Don't stray too close to the river, now. The kappa might pull you in.

00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:06.010
Man, that hits the spot!

00:01:13.580 --> 00:01:15.780
Welcome back, Miyuki!

00:01:16.290 --> 00:01:17.520
Grandma!

00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:24.490
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:01:24.490 --> 00:01:26.320
Smile Precure!

00:01:26.620 --> 00:01:27.220
Let's go!

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:28.760
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:28.760 --> 00:01:29.890
All together!

00:01:30.130 --> 00:01:31.500
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:33.700
Jump to tomorrow!

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:36.370
Smile Precure!

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:41.210
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:01:41.470 --> 00:01:46.640
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:01:47.010 --> 00:01:51.850
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:01:52.580 --> 00:01:57.790
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:01:58.160 --> 00:02:02.730
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:02:02.130 --> 00:02:02.690
So bright!

00:02:02.730 --> 00:02:07.900
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:02:08.270 --> 00:02:14.340
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:14.840
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:16.010
Let's go!

00:02:16.010 --> 00:02:18.710
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:02:18.710 --> 00:02:21.650
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:02:21.980 --> 00:02:26.450
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:02:25.820 --> 00:02:27.020
Girls! Let's go!

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:28.690
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:28.690 --> 00:02:29.820
Everybody!

00:02:29.850 --> 00:02:31.490
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:31.490 --> 00:02:34.030
Fly to the future!

00:02:34.360 --> 00:02:37.530
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:39.700
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:02:39.700 --> 00:02:42.000
Smile Precure!

00:02:55.390 --> 00:03:00.250
Wow, the view from here is absolutely amazing!

00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:02.970
It really is a beautiful place.

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:19.210
We're countin' on you to keep your promise. Got it, Candy?

00:03:19.910 --> 00:03:24.680
We brought you on the condition that you'll pretend to be a plushie when people are around.

00:03:24.690 --> 00:03:26.050
I know, jeez-kuru!

00:03:26.050 --> 00:03:28.080
Shh! Way too loud!

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:29.280
I'm sorry-kuru...

00:03:29.290 --> 00:03:31.420
Maybe <i>this</i> will help you recover from your journey.

00:03:32.600 --> 00:03:34.700
Oh, I can do that!

00:03:34.700 --> 00:03:36.960
Thank you, Dearie.

00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:40.330
You five take a break, anyway. You must be hot from your walk.

00:03:40.710 --> 00:03:42.110
Okay!

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:45.530
You've had a good crop this year, haven't you? The vegetables look great!

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:48.300
I'm chilling some down by the river.

00:03:48.310 --> 00:03:49.000
Shall we?

00:03:50.240 --> 00:03:50.910
Okay!

00:04:19.370 --> 00:04:21.000
This is really tasty!

00:04:21.020 --> 00:04:25.780
I know, right? My grandma grows the most delicious vegetables!

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:27.920
The river really chilled them well, too!

00:04:27.920 --> 00:04:30.000
A natural refrigerator if ever there was one.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:32.440
This is seriously good! Like, mega good!

00:04:32.440 --> 00:04:33.900
Not feeling the heat any more?

00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:35.920
Not at all! I'm good to go!

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:39.580
I'd forgotten how good cucumbers could be!

00:04:39.580 --> 00:04:41.230
These tomatoes are really sweet, too!

00:04:41.230 --> 00:04:41.760
Really?

00:04:42.820 --> 00:04:44.160
What's the matter, Nao-chan?

00:04:45.490 --> 00:04:49.770
Uhh, well, it's just... you think kappas could be real?

00:04:49.780 --> 00:04:50.750
You scared of them?

00:04:50.750 --> 00:04:51.570
Don't be silly!

00:04:51.830 --> 00:04:54.040
If that's what it is... Miyuki?

00:04:55.040 --> 00:04:55.960
Sure!

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:13.090
Here's a cucumber, Mr. Kappa-san, so don't play any tricks on us, okay?

00:05:16.050 --> 00:05:20.900
Kappas love cucumbers, so they won't bother you if you give them one.

00:05:20.900 --> 00:05:22.030
Right, Grandma?

00:05:22.030 --> 00:05:23.230
Right!

00:05:25.400 --> 00:05:27.840
Then... they really do exist?

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:28.700
No way...

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:33.480
Well, Grandma used to tell me lots of stories as a kid.

00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:36.750
One of them was about a kid being saved by a kappa...

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:38.910
...another kid was saved by a tengu, a wind spirit...

00:05:38.910 --> 00:05:40.920
...and this other kid was saved by a friendly spectre...

00:05:41.410 --> 00:05:42.950
Oh phew, they're just stories...

00:05:42.950 --> 00:05:44.820
These monsters sure do a lot of savin' people, huh?

00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:47.490
It's good that they're all nice spirits though!

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:51.790
Yeah. If you're nice to them, they'll help you out and bring you things.

00:05:51.790 --> 00:05:52.730
Presents?

00:05:52.930 --> 00:05:57.700
Yeah! They might give you fish, or wines, or rice cakes...

00:05:58.100 --> 00:06:02.500
But anyway, my grandma knows a lot of stories like that,

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:06.410
so she always used to tell them to me as I was growing up.

00:06:07.190 --> 00:06:11.480
I suppose that explains why you love fairytales so much.

00:06:18.490 --> 00:06:20.520
We're ready!

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:29.230
Huh...? Grandma, there's one too many plates here!

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:33.140
Is your friend not eating with us?

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:34.540
I can?

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:35.640
There we go.

00:06:35.640 --> 00:06:37.960
I wanna eat some too!

00:06:39.840 --> 00:06:43.280
Don't be silly, Grandma! She's just a plushie! She can't eat!

00:06:43.550 --> 00:06:44.750
Can't she?

00:06:45.660 --> 00:06:47.800
Got company I see, Tae-chan.

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:48.480
Why hello!

00:06:48.750 --> 00:06:51.790
These are nice and cool, so go ahead and eat them with the kids.

00:06:51.790 --> 00:06:54.390
You're always so kind.

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:56.830
Help yourself to those vegetables, if you want.

00:06:56.830 --> 00:06:59.360
That's quite the haul, isn't it?

00:06:59.360 --> 00:07:01.850
I've had a really good harvest this year.

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:03.650
Lucky you!

00:07:03.650 --> 00:07:05.440
Miyuki... you're heavy...

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:07.870
Ah, sorry!

00:07:07.870 --> 00:07:10.860
Thanks for the food!

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:15.190
They're so pretty!

00:07:13.940 --> 00:07:15.180
Oh, wow!

00:07:15.190 --> 00:07:18.610
Say, Grandma... why don't you come and live with us?

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:25.020
Mom and Dad are worried about how well you can cope on your own...

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:29.630
And I'd really like being able to spend more time with you!

00:07:30.290 --> 00:07:32.870
I mean, if you want...

00:07:33.460 --> 00:07:38.900
Yeah, I mean, it's nice out here, but it ain't exactly easy to get around.

00:07:39.690 --> 00:07:44.770
The summers seem most inhospitable, too. It would be awful if you fell ill...

00:07:45.260 --> 00:07:46.740
Well, Grandma?

00:07:47.880 --> 00:07:52.050
Thank you, Dear... but I rather like living here.

00:07:52.460 --> 00:07:53.450
But why?

00:07:54.720 --> 00:07:58.950
Everywhere I look here, I'm surrounded by treasures of mine.

00:07:58.950 --> 00:07:59.920
Treasures?

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:06.600
What treasures are those, Grandma?

00:08:06.910 --> 00:08:08.560
Not telling!

00:08:09.590 --> 00:08:11.750
There aren't many more of these, you know!

00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:13.140
Come join us already!

00:08:13.330 --> 00:08:16.390
Oh dear! Shall we, then?

00:08:20.450 --> 00:08:25.410
So that's why you said you wanted to visit your grandma, huh?

00:08:25.410 --> 00:08:28.180
Yeah... sorry for dragging you all along with me.

00:08:28.180 --> 00:08:32.920
Hey, no sweat. No way we were missin' a trek up into the mountains.

00:08:32.920 --> 00:08:33.850
Right?

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:36.530
Quite. It <i>is</i> a splendid place.

00:08:37.760 --> 00:08:38.490
A'ight then.

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:40.960
You comin'?

00:08:41.230 --> 00:08:42.120
Yeah!

00:08:42.630 --> 00:08:46.080
Time for a bit of Akane-chan magic!

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:49.000
Akane-san! Don't go hurting anyone with those, alright?

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:50.480
Aww, don't be like that!

00:08:50.480 --> 00:08:52.140
She's got every right to be worried!

00:08:52.150 --> 00:08:53.840
Boo...

00:09:08.120 --> 00:09:12.730
It's so hot... Why's it stinkin' hot at night, for God's sake?!

00:09:12.730 --> 00:09:15.870
You and I are gonna have a falling out over this, fur!

00:09:15.870 --> 00:09:17.780
Maybe I should trim you a bit...

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:25.550
Okay, no, no!

00:09:25.550 --> 00:09:27.680
I am not letting this heat drive me that far!

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:33.020
Maybe I'll go cool off in the mountains... get away from this heat...

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:38.760
Peace!

00:09:44.490 --> 00:09:45.700
Candy!

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:55.990
Let's Go: Elephant!

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:01.840
Let's water the vegetables together-kuru!

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:09.680
Make sure you get lots of water-kuru!

00:10:09.680 --> 00:10:11.940
Okay, go on-kuru!

00:10:18.860 --> 00:10:23.560
What can ya say? Difficult leavin' a place you've been livin' in forever.

00:10:23.930 --> 00:10:28.690
I had to move right after primary school, so I know <i>exactly</i> how she feels!

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:31.800
I know, I was like that when I moved.

00:10:32.070 --> 00:10:36.310
Wonder what that treasure of hers is, though...

00:10:36.310 --> 00:10:42.550
Well, I dunno, but you kinda start to understand it when you take in this view.

00:10:42.550 --> 00:10:44.270
Yeah...

00:10:44.270 --> 00:10:46.320
Look, a fox!

00:10:50.270 --> 00:10:52.520
The corn's done, girls!

00:10:52.520 --> 00:10:53.970
Okay!

00:10:57.310 --> 00:10:59.930
Ah, this is the life...

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:03.060
But now I'm feeling really hungry...

00:11:03.570 --> 00:11:06.910
It's been so hot, I'd lost my appetite.

00:11:11.590 --> 00:11:13.980
What's your problem?!

00:11:18.550 --> 00:11:20.490
The heck was that?!

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:21.550
Wolfrun!

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:25.570
You brats?! What are you doing here?

00:11:25.570 --> 00:11:28.660
Could ask you the same, soggy!

00:11:29.090 --> 00:11:30.630
I was just cooling off, when that—

00:11:38.330 --> 00:11:39.560
W-What's with you?

00:11:39.560 --> 00:11:42.650
Oh my, I think he must be hungry.

00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:45.400
I'll go fetch you something to eat.

00:11:45.400 --> 00:11:47.130
I'll just be a second.

00:11:47.130 --> 00:11:49.250
Hey, you, not so fast!

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:52.480
Why on earth aren't you scared of me?!

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:55.480
Scared? But you're such a cute little fox!

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:57.960
I'm not a fox, you dumb broad, I'm a wolf!

00:11:58.260 --> 00:12:01.430
Well, you're still very adorable!

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:07.050
Don't laugh at the poor guy!

00:12:07.050 --> 00:12:08.430
Sorry, can't help it...

00:12:08.430 --> 00:12:10.240
Okay, that's the final straw!

00:12:10.240 --> 00:12:15.570
I'll show you just how scary a wolf can be!

00:12:16.330 --> 00:12:19.410
This world will be stained with the worst possible conclusion...

00:12:19.830 --> 00:12:22.250
...a Bad End!

00:12:22.250 --> 00:12:26.250
The blank slate of your future will be clouded in darkness!

00:12:31.660 --> 00:12:36.160
The Bad Energy we gather from this old bag will resurrect the Emperor of Darkne—

00:12:39.400 --> 00:12:41.870
I said, the Bad Energy we get from this old—

00:12:42.840 --> 00:12:44.770
The Bad Energy...

00:12:45.470 --> 00:12:46.940
The Bad Energy...!

00:12:47.510 --> 00:12:48.970
The Bad Energy...!!

00:12:56.980 --> 00:12:59.070
She's not giving off any Bad Energy...

00:12:59.070 --> 00:12:59.820
Why not?!

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:01.950
Because she's not giving into despair!

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:07.730
But how?! Why aren't you reduced to despair!

00:13:08.030 --> 00:13:09.940
What reason would I have to be?

00:13:09.940 --> 00:13:12.870
Your future is going to blow absolute chunks!

00:13:13.110 --> 00:13:15.560
Well, life will deal you bad hands sometimes.

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:17.470
Dark clouds hang over you!

00:13:17.870 --> 00:13:19.940
As they have a habit of doing some days.

00:13:20.910 --> 00:13:24.210
But the clouds will always part, and the sun will shine through.

00:13:24.210 --> 00:13:27.670
It's never dark for too long.

00:13:29.070 --> 00:13:33.080
What's important is to live life with gusto and a smile.

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:35.550
If you do, happiness will never be too far off.

00:13:36.360 --> 00:13:37.520
Grandma...

00:13:37.720 --> 00:13:39.960
Miyuki's grandma is made of strong stuff!

00:13:39.970 --> 00:13:42.000
She is truly resolute in her positivity.

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:43.830
She's so cool!

00:13:46.150 --> 00:13:48.040
Stuff your smiles crap!

00:13:48.040 --> 00:13:51.840
I'll bring you despair the old-fashioned way!

00:13:51.840 --> 00:13:53.770
I can't wait to see you cry, you old bat!

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:56.030
She just went to get your food.

00:13:56.030 --> 00:13:57.240
She's not even here?!

00:13:57.570 --> 00:13:59.890
Ah, that does it!

00:13:59.890 --> 00:14:02.800
Come on out, Super Akanbe!

00:14:04.850 --> 00:14:07.720
Super Akanbe!

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:14.100
Alright, Super Akanbe! Toast her and her stupid house to ashes!

00:14:14.100 --> 00:14:17.770
Super Akanbe!

00:14:17.770 --> 00:14:19.670
I don't think so!

00:14:23.440 --> 00:14:24.640
Ready?

00:14:25.200 --> 00:14:28.080
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:14:28.080 --> 00:14:29.030
Go!

00:14:30.070 --> 00:14:31.420
Go, go!

00:14:31.810 --> 00:14:33.420
Let's go!

00:14:45.720 --> 00:14:48.730
The light of the future, shining bright!

00:14:50.020 --> 00:14:51.840
Cure Happy!

00:14:54.670 --> 00:14:56.390
Dazzling sun!

00:14:56.390 --> 00:14:58.330
Hot-blooded power!

00:14:59.430 --> 00:15:00.990
Cure Sunny!

00:15:03.720 --> 00:15:06.830
Rock, paper, scissors! Sparkling bright...

00:15:08.230 --> 00:15:10.010
Cure Peace!

00:15:11.870 --> 00:15:15.450
Laying down the gauntlet, with courage blazing!

00:15:16.610 --> 00:15:18.830
Cure March!

00:15:21.160 --> 00:15:24.750
A gentle heart as pure as the driven snow...

00:15:25.760 --> 00:15:27.590
Cure Beauty!

00:15:29.480 --> 00:15:32.340
Our five lights will blaze a path to the future!

00:15:38.110 --> 00:15:42.250
Shining bright, Smile Precure!

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:47.390
Super Akan...!

00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:56.530
Akan...

00:16:08.940 --> 00:16:12.260
Akanbe...!

00:16:15.550 --> 00:16:18.720
We're not letting you ruin my grandma's treasures!

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:23.290
Huh? Treasures?! I don't see any treasures!

00:16:23.790 --> 00:16:26.290
They're everywhere you look!

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:29.760
Her home, her fields, the river, the mountains...

00:16:30.270 --> 00:16:33.800
Everything you see here is my grandma's treasure!

00:16:35.300 --> 00:16:36.400
No, see...

00:16:37.150 --> 00:16:41.440
...if those were her treasures, why be all secretive about it?

00:16:41.440 --> 00:16:43.170
That's true, I guess...

00:16:43.170 --> 00:16:45.240
I wonder why she is keeping it secret...

00:16:45.240 --> 00:16:47.180
Maybe it's <i>buried</i> treasure!

00:16:47.180 --> 00:16:48.280
No way!

00:16:48.290 --> 00:16:50.840
Are you gonna quit babblin' already?!

00:16:50.840 --> 00:16:52.580
Get them, Super Akanbe!

00:16:52.580 --> 00:16:55.810
Super Akan...

00:17:05.890 --> 00:17:06.900
Oh no...

00:17:07.530 --> 00:17:09.130
Precure!

00:17:10.100 --> 00:17:12.000
That's it, Super Akanbe!

00:17:12.500 --> 00:17:16.110
Now's our chance to burn that house of hers to the ground!

00:17:17.150 --> 00:17:21.950
Super Akan...

00:17:21.950 --> 00:17:23.300
Don't do it!

00:17:30.790 --> 00:17:32.460
...be!

00:17:33.860 --> 00:17:36.980
Noooo!

00:17:45.430 --> 00:17:46.340
The heck?!

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:55.200
Super Akanbe...

00:17:57.090 --> 00:17:59.450
Akanbe...?

00:17:59.620 --> 00:18:01.320
The heck was that...?

00:18:01.330 --> 00:18:02.680
A tengu's wind...

00:18:03.990 --> 00:18:06.390
It's just like in a story Grandma told me.

00:18:06.760 --> 00:18:11.460
It said that gusts of wind from the mountains are from a tengu's fan.

00:18:14.890 --> 00:18:18.380
Get up already, Super Akanbe!

00:18:18.380 --> 00:18:20.590
Akanbe...

00:18:24.440 --> 00:18:28.480
Super Akanbe?!

00:18:30.850 --> 00:18:32.910
You're that thing from earlier!

00:18:33.650 --> 00:18:34.820
Get back here, you little—

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:45.060
Well, God knows what's goin' on, but...

00:18:46.280 --> 00:18:47.670
Now's our chance, Happy!

00:18:52.480 --> 00:18:56.090
Pegasus, grant us your power!

00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:12.760
Princess Happy!

00:19:13.160 --> 00:19:14.960
Princess Sunny!

00:19:15.360 --> 00:19:17.160
Princess Peace!

00:19:17.360 --> 00:19:19.370
Princess March!

00:19:19.700 --> 00:19:21.570
Princess Beauty!

00:19:25.710 --> 00:19:29.660
Precure: Princess Form!

00:19:36.750 --> 00:19:39.830
May the light of hope shine!

00:19:40.360 --> 00:19:43.100
Let it soar to a radiant future!

00:19:48.210 --> 00:19:49.820
Precure...

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:53.230
Rainbow...

00:19:53.230 --> 00:19:56.340
Burst!

00:20:01.020 --> 00:20:04.660
Akanbe...!

00:20:09.040 --> 00:20:13.070
Shine, Happy Smiles!

00:20:21.630 --> 00:20:25.230
Now we have eight Décors!

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:28.230
That was a close one...

00:20:28.240 --> 00:20:34.070
I'll get you for this, you got that?!

00:20:38.990 --> 00:20:40.880
That's a shame...

00:20:41.260 --> 00:20:45.830
I made all this food for him, and the nice fox went and left.

00:20:49.370 --> 00:20:51.100
This is really good!

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:53.850
I haven't had inari sushi rolls in ages!

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:56.710
I make them with my brothers a lot, actually.

00:20:57.430 --> 00:20:59.580
Ever the artisan, Nao.

00:21:01.410 --> 00:21:02.850
Say, Grandma...

00:21:02.850 --> 00:21:03.870
Yes, Dear?

00:21:04.350 --> 00:21:06.340
You know those treasures you mentioned?

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:11.710
...Ah, never mind!

00:21:14.380 --> 00:21:15.250
Oh...?

00:21:21.620 --> 00:21:23.260
This wind again...

00:21:23.260 --> 00:21:26.130
But it seems to be a more gentle breeze this time...

00:21:26.390 --> 00:21:28.960
Well, this is a privilege.

00:21:28.960 --> 00:21:31.100
The mountain creatures are trying to say thank you.

00:21:31.630 --> 00:21:33.130
The mountain creatures?

00:21:33.140 --> 00:21:36.690
Did you girls do a good deed, perhaps?

00:21:43.220 --> 00:21:44.530
Hrm...?

00:21:46.210 --> 00:21:47.150
Not telling!

00:21:51.130 --> 00:21:55.310
We ought to go and check the shrine by the river, a little later.

00:21:55.310 --> 00:21:56.300
There's a shrine?

00:21:56.300 --> 00:21:57.560
There is!

00:21:57.560 --> 00:22:02.350
And I think our friends on the mountain may have left you a little thank you...

00:23:39.530 --> 00:23:41.390
Whooooooo...

00:23:41.390 --> 00:23:42.740
It's a ghost!

00:23:42.740 --> 00:23:44.070
Noooo!

00:23:44.070 --> 00:23:45.140
The heck?!

00:23:45.140 --> 00:23:46.900
I'm afraid Nao is rather scared of ghosts.

00:23:46.900 --> 00:23:48.900
I-I'm not exactly fond of them either!

00:23:48.900 --> 00:23:50.250
You scared too, Miyuki?

00:23:50.650 --> 00:23:51.780
I-I'm not scared!

00:23:51.780 --> 00:23:53.410
I'm not scared at all-kuru!

00:23:53.420 --> 00:23:55.520
I will have revenge!

00:23:57.250 --> 00:23:58.790
Smile Precure:

00:24:02.450 --> 00:24:04.580
Find your ultra happy smile!
